{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene includes a laptop, a white shirt, a watch, and a red apple. The laptop is positioned to the left of the shirt. Directly below the laptop is a watch, and below the watch is a red apple; the laptop, watch, and apple are all aligned vertically. Additionally, for every tie present in the image, it is located below the shirt and aligned vertically with it.",
